      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Any unconsciousness and especially that of old people refers to direct danger to life and requires immediate medical intervening. A diagnostic plan will not be adequate in association to the multifariour etiological factors and can delay in a special case the beginning of an aimed therapy. The unconscious patient must have a clinical treatment. The author describes the diagnostic of the most important comatose states in the age."},
